{"3743260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Virtue and a Sledgehammer", "steam_appid": 3743260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Most people resort to therapy. But you chose the brave option. A sledgehammer.<br><br>In Virtue and a Sledgehammer, explore the remains of your hometown haunted by the android ghosts of your digitized neighbors. There won't always be a clear path, so create your own by knocking down any structures that stand in your way.<br><br>It will be a painful journey, not only because of the assault from the robots that have taken over life in the mountains, but because of the memories you’ll unearth—sometimes warm, but often traumatic—as you destroy the remnants of your childhood.<br><br>A game about family, traditions, and being a misfit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/7a8b0e133888bda49b26f52bd2658197.poster.avif?t=1788251891\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/7a8b0e133888bda49b26f52bd2658197.webm?t=1788251891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/7a8b0e133888bda49b26f52bd2658197.mp4?t=1788251891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >20lbs of Physical Media</h2>Wield your sledgehammer like an instrument of reckoning, swinging through the swathes of mechanical human facsimiles and the buildings they call home. But will violent catharsis salve your soul, or make the pain burn brighter?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/47787f36798fe3569c5ce1d516157ccf.poster.avif?t=1788251891\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/47787f36798fe3569c5ce1d516157ccf.webm?t=1788251891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/47787f36798fe3569c5ce1d516157ccf.mp4?t=1788251891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A narrative experience at heart</h2>You can’t tear down the place you were born without awakening a few ghosts. The cinematic sequences of interactive fiction will reveal your fears, desires, and your family’s knotty web of virtues and flaws.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/ac03ef06c0bee75d560b0b432104e0d9.poster.avif?t=1788251891\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/ac03ef06c0bee75d560b0b432104e0d9.webm?t=1788251891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/ac03ef06c0bee75d560b0b432104e0d9.mp4?t=1788251891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I wish you could experience life without pain</h2>Flesh is a source of aches and tainted humors.<br>It's only now, devoid of bones, devoid of hunger, that I can tell you...<br>I have never been happier.", "about_the_game": "Most people resort to therapy. But you chose the brave option. A sledgehammer.<br><br>In Virtue and a Sledgehammer, explore the remains of your hometown haunted by the android ghosts of your digitized neighbors. There won't always be a clear path, so create your own by knocking down any structures that stand in your way.<br><br>It will be a painful journey, not only because of the assault from the robots that have taken over life in the mountains, but because of the memories you’ll unearth—sometimes warm, but often traumatic—as you destroy the remnants of your childhood.<br><br>A game about family, traditions, and being a misfit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/7a8b0e133888bda49b26f52bd2658197.poster.avif?t=1788251891\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/7a8b0e133888bda49b26f52bd2658197.webm?t=1788251891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/7a8b0e133888bda49b26f52bd2658197.mp4?t=1788251891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >20lbs of Physical Media</h2>Wield your sledgehammer like an instrument of reckoning, swinging through the swathes of mechanical human facsimiles and the buildings they call home. But will violent catharsis salve your soul, or make the pain burn brighter?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/47787f36798fe3569c5ce1d516157ccf.poster.avif?t=1788251891\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/47787f36798fe3569c5ce1d516157ccf.webm?t=1788251891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/47787f36798fe3569c5ce1d516157ccf.mp4?t=1788251891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A narrative experience at heart</h2>You can’t tear down the place you were born without awakening a few ghosts. The cinematic sequences of interactive fiction will reveal your fears, desires, and your family’s knotty web of virtues and flaws.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/ac03ef06c0bee75d560b0b432104e0d9.poster.avif?t=1788251891\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/ac03ef06c0bee75d560b0b432104e0d9.webm?t=1788251891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/extras/ac03ef06c0bee75d560b0b432104e0d9.mp4?t=1788251891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >I wish you could experience life without pain</h2>Flesh is a source of aches and tainted humors.<br>It's only now, devoid of bones, devoid of hunger, that I can tell you...<br>I have never been happier.", "short_description": "Go back to your hometown and tear it down with a sledgehammer in this narrative exploration game. Confront your past in a devastating story about feeling like you no longer belong in the place you grew up.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/93488f22c9da9e61dd2b9092d149695bcc846e71/header.jpg?t=1788251891", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/93440a9d2ff2cca22f527ee639ff7d2dae512c73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788251891", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743260/93440a9d2ff2cca22f527ee639ff7d2dae512c73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788251891", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3550H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 / Radeon RX 570 / Arc A380<b